<h1>🎵 What a Friend We Have in Jesus</h1>

<div class="info">
<p><b>Author:</b> Joseph M. Scriven</p>
<p><b>Composer:</b> Charles C. Converse</p>
<p><b>Year:</b> 1855</p>
<p><b>Theme:</b> Prayer and Trust in Jesus</p>
<p><b>Scripture:</b> Philippians 4:6</p>
</div>

<div class="lyrics">

<p>
What a Friend we have in Jesus,<br>
All our sins and griefs to bear!<br>
What a privilege to carry<br>
Everything to God in prayer!<br>
O what peace we often forfeit,<br>
O what needless pain we bear,<br>
All because we do not carry<br>
Everything to God in prayer!
</p>

